I just got NetHack 3 Patchlevel 2 running on my Mac II. It comes in
at ~600K.  I've added stuff like menus, color output (when possible),
speeded up text output, smaller level and save files, IBM-like
extended character set (YUCHH I know but it's got the characters to make
a nice looking screen) - takes a while to get used to the screen
if you;ve played old versions of NetHack without a custom font.

I'm moving to Redmond WA to start my work term so I should be able to
get the executable to comp.binaries.mac and the source diffs to
the development team within a week or so of moving. :-)

The only option I didn't put into the Mac version was STRONGHOLD and that's
because it was so new to me I didn't have enough time to get it
working with the other stuff.

